  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Second Line of Financing for Uganda Development Bank Limited (UDBL)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed Facility aims to achieve the following objectives:
&#x2022;Improve access to long-term financing for local SMEs and large enterprises to finance expansion and productivity improvements across various sectors in Uganda, including agriculture, industrial and infrastructure sectors.
&#x2022;Strengthen Uganda&#x2019;s financing market through increased availability of long-term Islamic financing and increased investment in key sectors of the country&#x2019;s economy.
&#x2022;Boost the commercialization and competitiveness of local agri-food enterprises in line with the country&#x2019;s development blueprint to improve the food security situation.</narrative>
  </description>
